<title>USA: National Home Health sets 6 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>National Home Health sets 6 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SCARSDALE, N.Y. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Home Health Care Corp said Thursday that it declared a six percent stock dividend, payable December 4 to stockholders of record on November 8.</p>
<p>In a release Thursday, the company said the dividend increases outstanding shares to about 5.1 million from 4.8 million.</p>
</text>
